{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"zettel.1778003596758","title":"Review comments should be encoded as guardrails, not left in PR threads","desc":"Review warnings that recur are institution-level knowledge and should become automated guardrails.","updated":1778004109410,"created":1778003608572,"tags":["zettel","guardrail","review","agentic-engineering"],"custom":{},"fname":"zettel.1778003596758","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"0f1a694194eaeea5e615216f9184a399","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1778003596758","id":"zettel.1778003596758","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.zettel","alias":"zettel","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.zettel"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1778003596758","id":"zettel.1778003596758","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.guardrail","alias":"guardrail","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.guardrail"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1778003596758","id":"zettel.1778003596758","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.review","alias":"review","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.review"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1778003596758","id":"zettel.1778003596758","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.agentic-engineering","alias":"agentic-engineering","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.agentic-engineering"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.1778003596758","id":"zettel.1778003596758","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.agentic-engineering.before-after-judgement-harness","position":{"start":{"line":14,"column":3,"offset":796},"end":{"line":14,"column":63,"offset":856},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.agentic-engineering.before-after-judgement-harness"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.1778003596758","id":"zettel.1778003596758","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.agentic-engineering.self-hosted-agent-runner","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":3,"offset":859},"end":{"line":15,"column":57,"offset":913},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.agentic-engineering.self-hosted-agent-runner"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.1778003596758","id":"zettel.1778003596758","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"til.ai.semgrep.guardrails","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":3,"offset":916},"end":{"line":16,"column":32,"offset":945},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"til.ai.semgrep.guardrails"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.1778003596758","id":"zettel.1778003596758","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"zettel.20260506180000","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":3,"offset":948},"end":{"line":17,"column":28,"offset":973},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"zettel.20260506180000"}}],"anchors":{},"children":[],"parent":"zettel","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"review-comments-should-be-encoded-as-guardrails-not-left-in-pr-threads\">Review comments should be encoded as guardrails, not left in PR threads<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#review-comments-should-be-encoded-as-guardrails-not-left-in-pr-threads\"></a></h1>\n<p>Review comments seperti \"jangan query DB di loop\" atau \"ini rawan N+1\" bukan hanya feedback untuk satu PR. Itu judgement operasional yang harus dipindahkan ke workflow sebagai guardrail, bukan disimpan di thread review.</p>\n<p>Jika peringatan yang sama terus muncul, senior engineer paling bernilai ketika dia tidak lagi mengulanginya di review. Yang lebih penting adalah membuat rule atau sensor yang mencegah kelas kesalahan itu, misalnya:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Semgrep rule untuk pola query di loop</li>\n<li>regression test query count</li>\n<li>runtime profiler / request path observability</li>\n<li>stable <code>./.ai/commands/verify.sh</code> yang menjalankan semua sensor tersebut</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Dengan begini, knowledge jadi reusable dan review manusia bisa fokus ke judgement domain/arsitektur, bukan koreksi kesalahan operasional yang berulang.</p>\n<p>Related:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.agentic-engineering.before-after-judgement-harness\">Before-After: Senior Judgement ke Harness</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.agentic-engineering.self-hosted-agent-runner\">Self-Hosted Cloud Agent Runner</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/til.ai.semgrep.guardrails\">Semgrep sebagai guardrail agentic engineering</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260506180000\">verify.sh is a verification entrypoint, not a sensor</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a class=\"color-tag\" style=\"--tag-color: #a03623;\" href=\"/sotoy/notes/tags.zettel\">zettel</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">guardrail (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">review (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">agentic-engineering (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"enableMarker":false},"copyNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"title"},"templateHierarchy":"template"},"workspace":{"dendronVersion":"0.83.0","vaults":[{"fsPath":"vault"}],"journal":{"dailyDomain":"daily","name":"journal","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd","addBehavior":"childOfDomain"},"scratch":{"name":"scratch","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd.HHmmss","addBehavior":"asOwnDomain"},"task":{"name":"","dateFormat":"","addBehavior":"childOfCurrent","statusSymbols":{"":" ","wip":"w"